<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hwan Yung share trading to resume - bourse.</title>
<headline>Hwan Yung share trading to resume - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Stock Exchange said trading of Hwan Yung Steel Industry Co shares would resume from the start of Wednesday's session as the company had settled payment on promissory notes.  </p>
<p>The exchange suspended trading in Hwan Yung shares in late Tuesday morning, citing rumours about the company's financial problem.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
